{"id":2662,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2025年12月19日14:00至18:00，经济与管理学院心理辅导站在怡丁苑女生宿舍北门楼下举办了“爱你老己，明天见”主题心理健康活动，近200名同学积极参与。活动通过书写爱己计划、践行自我关怀等形式，引导同学们关注自身心理健康，传递温暖与正能量。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QM7nqkMlnfol78LpNWVnzUbolC4olQv7M8rRUmMVLzLbUNl0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7USybU1ysL8nfM7rfL4r7LNUsL77aLRAVnR7bo7-sM4fFLN78U8UsnzrFMmVknzUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PL4CbgtA8pU6cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21369&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CDA9B73DA4EA35D2D70A008ED198B770/2A4CD7E5/61BE4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Qn7Vq7nmC8L4QfMp4TkUzVfMzWkMmvvsMRfRM4-8U4LDo7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8LYybn1h2LNn7LmQ7ol7bMRMkn774UzUZnRTVL4rkM4AFM87sUmvsMRfFnmC8nlLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PL4CbgtA8pU6cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21369&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>活动现场，同学们认真在便利贴上写下对自己的承诺与期许，这些充满心意的便利贴被集中展示，成为校园里一道温暖的风景。</p><p>本次活动是学院心理辅导站推进学生心理健康教育的具体实践，旨在帮助学生在日常生活中学会自我关爱、积极生活。未来，学院心理辅导站将继续围绕学生心理成长需求，开展更多贴近学生、形式多样的心理健康活动，进一步营造温暖互助、积极向上的校园氛围。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QL8LqYnRLPoRC8opR-inNLYM4L4Lm7vPnNLsnR9PMzGZol-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfU1yYoShVn7WVo7M7MznRLlMRo7WVMR-PnmlinmWVnNrFoR-iolWkM8WFMlV2UmLJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PL4CbgtA8pU6cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21369&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FAB29EDBE8CD54C1CC8BE421F55F2EFE/8259BB7B/5AFB3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QU8VqkUlV2U4rkMpznRnzrkolU8L7-vDM4fkL4VfU4lDoRC0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiUYh2n1hRUmUsnmV7L8UDoz9anlCPU4UYMmvDMzvboR6Fo7UbozV2L4MFnlnkozvJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PL4CbgtA8pU6cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21369&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QM7nqkMlnfol78LpNWVnzUbolC4olQv7M8rRUmMVLzLbUNl0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7USybU1ysL8nfM7rfL4r7LNUsL77aLRAVnR7bo7-sM4fFLN78U8UsnzrFMmVknzUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-PL4CbgtA8pU6cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=21369&e=.png"}